   "text": "R15 body parts tracked for the skeleton and the dynamic bounding box"
  },
  {
   "line": 14995,
   "text": "Text height overrides for small pixel fonts; others use the font's info size"
  },
  {
   "line": 15001,
   "text": "Per-player ESP constructor: builds drawings, gradients and per-frame updates for a dueler"
  },
  {
   "line": 15026,
   "text": "Bounding box: dynamic mode projects all body part corners, otherwise uses root height offsets"
  },
  {
   "line": 15068,
   "text": "Static bounds: box height from points above and below the root; fixed size beyond 600 studs"
  },
  {
